1
00:00:06,158 --> 00:00:08,098
杰 我回来了
Jay, I'm home.

2
00:00:08,198 --> 00:00:09,678
曼尼打电话回来了吗
Did Manny call?

3
00:00:09,678 --> 00:00:10,929
没 因为他啥事也没有
No, because he's fine.

4
00:00:10,998 --> 00:00:13,558
他是去睡衣派对 又不是黑帮火拼
It was a slumber party, not a gang fight.

5
00:00:13,628 --> 00:00:16,268
我只是想他融入集体
I just want him to fit in.

6
00:00:16,338 --> 00:00:18,897
我要去冲个澡 你要一起来吗
I'm gonna take a shower. Do you care to join me?

7
00:00:18,957 --> 00:00:21,857
宝贝 车库的小提箱里有一杆枪
You know, honey, there's a gun in the footlocker in the garage.

8
00:00:21,927 --> 00:00:23,917
要是我哪天脑袋发昏拒绝和你共浴
If I ever say no to that question,

9
00:00:23,917 --> 00:00:25,387
你直接一枪打死我吧
I want you to use it on me.

10
00:00:26,847 --> 00:00:28,577
玛丽·马克小姐 马克马克
Miss Mary Mack, Mack, Mack.

11
00:00:28,677 --> 00:00:31,157
-穿成黑色 黑色黑色 -嘘 别出声
- All dressed in black, black, black. - Shh, shh.

12
00:00:31,267 --> 00:00:33,457
-怎么了 -银色扣子 扣子扣子
- What's wrong? - With silver buttons, buttons, buttons.

13
00:00:33,517 --> 00:00:35,957
在她背上 背上背上
All down her back, back, back.

14
00:00:36,017 --> 00:00:38,536
他们怎么不打架了
Why aren't they trying to hurt each other?

15
00:00:38,606 --> 00:00:40,796
我也不知道 我震惊得都不敢动
I don't know, but I'm afraid to move.

16
00:00:40,896 --> 00:00:44,006
-你玩得真好 -谢谢
- You're really good at this. - Thanks.

17
00:00:44,066 --> 00:00:45,716
克莱尔 这是怎么一回事啊
What is happening, Claire?

18
00:00:47,766 --> 00:00:48,597
味道如何
What do you think?

19
00:00:48,656 --> 00:00:50,596
绝对正宗的松饼啊
Now, that is a scone.

20
00:00:50,656 --> 00:00:52,926
零黄油 无脂肪
No butter. Nonfat.

21
00:00:53,036 --> 00:00:55,226
得瑟
Shut up.

22
00:00:55,286 --> 00:00:57,305
我去看看莉莉
I'm gonna go check on Lily.

23
00:01:01,755 --> 00:01:04,565
-惊喜哦 -妈
- Surprise! - Mom!

24
00:01:06,715 --> 00:01:07,675
怎么回事
What's that?

25
00:01:07,675 --> 00:01:10,575
听起来像是有鸟撞上玻璃了
Sounds like a bird hit the window.

26
00:01:10,635 --> 00:01:13,075
天呐 这是个凶兆
Oh, God. That's a bad sign.

27
00:01:13,755 --> 00:01:15,744
很痛啊 混蛋
Ow! That hurt, jerk!

28
00:01:16,384 --> 00:01:18,164
我要杀了你 你个白痴
Ow! I'm gonna kill you, stupid!

29
00:01:19,974 --> 00:01:21,074
剧情峰回路转吗
What happened?

30
00:01:21,074 --> 00:01:22,754
现在我郁闷了
Now I'm sad.

31
00:01:22,854 --> 00:01:25,214
-你好 宝贝 -你好 我...
- Hi, honey. Mmm! - Hi. I, uh-

32
00:01:25,274 --> 00:01:27,694
我不知道你要来 你之前没给我打电话啊
I- I didn't know you were in town. You didn't call.

33
00:01:27,694 --> 00:01:31,784
我等不及要见我的小孙女了 她在哪儿
Well, I couldn't wait to see your new baby. Where is she?

34
00:01:31,784 --> 00:01:34,073
-米奇尔 是谁啊 -是我妈
- Mitchell, who was that? - It's my mom.

35
00:01:34,073 --> 00:01:35,133
你就使劲儿忽悠吧
Oh, yeah, right,

36
00:01:35,133 --> 00:01:36,613
上回她来的时候
'cause the last time she was here,

37
00:01:36,613 --> 00:01:39,403
冰箱门上的磁铁被摆成了五边...
the refrigerator magnets rearranged themselves into a penta...

38
00:01:39,403 --> 00:01:40,434
真是奶奶啊
Grandma!

39
00:01:57,072 --> 00:01:59,262
妈 你拽着她的脚干嘛呢
Mom. Mom, what are you doing to her legs?

40
00:01:59,262 --> 00:02:01,872
打太极 我在塞多纳时每天都打
Tai chi. I did it every day in Sedona.

41
00:02:01,872 --> 00:02:03,562
卡梅隆 你也该试试
Cameron, you should try it.

42
00:02:06,042 --> 00:02:08,082
米奇尔的妈妈对我...
Mitchell's mother has a problem...

43
00:02:08,082 --> 00:02:09,772
有成见
with me.

44
00:02:10,422 --> 00:02:11,922
比如去年圣诞节
Last Christmas, for example,

45
00:02:11,922 --> 00:02:15,821
她送了我一台健身器材和生菜烘干机
she gave me a piece of exercise equipment and a lettuce dryer.

46
00:02:16,181 --> 00:02:17,201
问题的重点是
So, to recap,

47
00:02:17,201 --> 00:02:19,281
我送给她的是一副华丽的钻石耳环
I gave her a gorgeous pair of diamond earrings,

48
00:02:19,281 --> 00:02:21,571
她送的礼物却暗示我很肥
and she gave me a hint.

49
00:02:22,741 --> 00:02:26,171
住在塞多纳让我改变了许多
And living in Sedona has been transformational.

50
00:02:26,171 --> 00:02:29,921
我每天早上起床后 去参加冥想集会
I get up every morning, and I go to a Vortex meditation site...

51
00:02:29,921 --> 00:02:31,760
在高僧的指导下
and work with a shaman to

52
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:35,510
终于参透精神世界的奥秘了
finally understand how to live my spirituality.

53
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,011
真棒
Yikes.

54
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,890
我领悟到
And I've learned that

55
00:02:38,890 --> 00:02:43,660
让我的修行更上一层楼的唯一方法...
the only way I can move to the next level of my awakening...

56
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:46,600
就是要想办法...
is if we all can somehow...

57
00:02:46,660 --> 00:02:48,480
克服...
get past...

58
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,621
那件事的阴影
the incident.

59
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,280
完了
Oh, no.

60
00:02:51,589 --> 00:02:53,369
"那件事"
The incident.

61
00:02:53,369 --> 00:02:54,259
不堪回首啊
Oh, boy.

62
00:02:54,259 --> 00:02:58,279
我想恭喜杰和可爱的歌洛莉亚
I would like to congratulate Jay and the lovely Gloria.

63
00:02:58,609 --> 00:03:00,539
我为他们感到高兴
I'm very happy for them.

64
00:03:00,829 --> 00:03:03,159
我想和杰举办一次盛大的婚礼
I wanted a big, beautiful wedding with Jay...

65
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:05,329
因为我和我前夫的婚礼是在
because my ex-husband and I got married...

66
00:03:05,329 --> 00:03:08,339
哥伦比亚一间很小的法官办公室里举办的
in a tiny little office of a judge in Colombia.

67
00:03:08,339 --> 00:03:10,098
我妈妈想去参加婚礼
My mother wanted to go to the wedding

68
00:03:10,098 --> 00:03:12,668
以显示自己对前夫再婚一事十分大度
to show everyone how okay she was with all of it,

69
00:03:12,668 --> 00:03:16,258
所以我说服我爸和歌洛莉亚邀请她
so I convinced Dad and Gloria to invite her.

70
00:03:17,318 --> 00:03:19,618
当时是谁警告你 那是史上最烂的主意
Who warned you that that was the worst idea ever?

71
00:03:19,818 --> 00:03:21,238
是谁
Anyone?

72
00:03:21,238 --> 00:03:22,109
是谁啊
Anyone?

73
00:03:23,938 --> 00:03:25,479
当然 我已经开始新生活了
Of course, I've-I've moved on.

74
00:03:26,448 --> 00:03:28,068
我本来要带男朋友来的
I was supposed to come with a date,

75
00:03:28,068 --> 00:03:29,907
但他闪到腰了
but he just hurt his back,

76
00:03:29,907 --> 00:03:34,097
真有点讽刺啊 因为他可是又年轻又健康
which is very ironic because he's young and-and healthy.

77
00:03:34,287 --> 00:03:35,787
我妈妈在婚宴上...
My mom started drinking...

78
00:03:35,787 --> 00:03:38,857
狂饮一种叫做"哥伦比亚淫棍"的鸡尾酒
these cocktails called "Horny Colombians"...

79
00:03:38,857 --> 00:03:41,687
和歌洛莉亚的叔叔们大拼酒量
with some of Gloria's uncles,

80
00:03:41,687 --> 00:03:44,567
那酒名显然说的就是那帮家伙
whom apparently the drink was named after.

81
00:03:44,567 --> 00:03:46,068
拜托 他们很好玩
Oh, come on. They were funny.

82
00:03:48,366 --> 00:03:49,707
他们一直摸我屁股
They kept patting my butt.

83
00:03:49,936 --> 00:03:52,286
有人自恋了哦
Somebody's full of herself.

84
00:03:52,746 --> 00:03:55,666
他们说 那是哥伦比亚婚礼的传统习俗
It's a- It's a Colombian wedding tradition, they said.

85
00:03:57,876 --> 00:03:59,816
我来祝个酒
I would like to make a toast.

86
00:04:00,106 --> 00:04:02,616
是啊 外婆醉得不行了
Yeah. Nanna got totally wasted.

87
00:04:02,616 --> 00:04:04,086
真的很好玩
Uh, it was really funny.

88
00:04:05,086 --> 00:04:06,327
然后就乌七八糟的了
Then it was gross.

89
00:04:07,365 --> 00:04:11,175
敬新娘 以及新郎 也就是我的前夫
To the bride and the groom- my ex.

90
00:04:11,485 --> 00:04:13,025
我们一起生活了35年
Thirty-five years we were together,

91
00:04:13,025 --> 00:04:15,815
而他见到小骚货10分钟不到就跟着跑了
and he couldn't wait 10 minutes to run off with Charo.

92
00:04:16,815 --> 00:04:18,575
开个玩笑而已
That's a joke.

93
00:04:20,255 --> 00:04:23,875
说真的 我知道他们是天生一对
Seriously, I knew they were perfect for each other...

94
00:04:24,195 --> 00:04:27,014
因为新郎"财大"气粗 而新娘"胸大"乳挺
when I saw his wallet and her boobs.

95
00:04:28,024 --> 00:04:29,294
把你的脏手拿开
Take your hands off me!

96
00:04:30,204 --> 00:04:33,294
-妈 妈 -米奇尔 放松
- Mom. Mom. - Oh, relax, Mitchell.

97
00:04:33,294 --> 00:04:34,755
怎么 你今天也变得跟克莱尔一样了吗
What, did you take your Claire pill?

98
00:04:35,604 --> 00:04:37,164
-别别 -我们去呼吸一下新鲜空气 好吗
- No, no. - Let's just go get a little fresh air, okay?

99
00:04:37,164 --> 00:04:38,805
然后就变得诡异了
And then it got weird.

100
00:04:39,084 --> 00:04:40,904
-我是歌洛莉亚 我是歌洛莉亚 -我抓住她了
- I'm Gloria! I'm Gloria! - I got her.

101
00:04:40,904 --> 00:04:42,844
吻我吧 吻我吧
Kiss me! Oh, hey, kiss me!

102
00:04:42,844 --> 00:04:45,613
不 天呐
No! Oh, geez.

103
00:04:47,273 --> 00:04:49,403
外婆力大如金刚
Nanna is really strong.

104
00:04:49,653 --> 00:04:53,563
哎呀呦 哎呀哟 啊嘶嘚啊嘶哆
Ayayayayay! Ooh! Ayayayayay!

105
00:04:55,223 --> 00:04:56,943
当我对前夫说出婚誓时
During my vows to my first husband,

106
00:04:56,943 --> 00:04:59,893
几个毒贩子冲了进来 暗杀了法官
drug dealers burst in and assassinated the judge.

107
00:05:00,203 --> 00:05:01,433
没想到二婚的情形更可怕
This was way worse.

108
00:05:01,433 --> 00:05:03,733
说什么好呢 我就是能让女人如痴如"狂"
What can I say? I drive women crazy.

109
00:05:05,842 --> 00:05:07,312
可能有点太快了
It's too soon, I guess.

110
00:05:08,702 --> 00:05:11,072
妈 所有人都会去的
Everybody is going to be there, Mom!

111
00:05:11,072 --> 00:05:11,743
我不管
I don't care.

112
00:05:11,892 --> 00:05:13,312
你爸爸和我都不会允许你
Your father and I are not about to let you

113
00:05:13,312 --> 00:05:15,312
开两小时的车去看一个演唱会
drive two hours to go to a concert...

114
00:05:15,312 --> 00:05:17,062
然后跟一帮男孩子混一晚上
and then spend the night with a bunch of boys,

115
00:05:17,062 --> 00:05:19,672
尤其是和你那个17岁的性冲动男友
especially that 17-year-old hormone you're dating.

116
00:05:19,672 --> 00:05:21,252
全程都有人监护的
It's totally supervised.

117
00:05:21,252 --> 00:05:22,503
是吗 谁监护
Oh, really? By whom?

118
00:05:22,602 --> 00:05:24,041
斯宾塞·潘丁的叔叔
By Spencer Patine's uncle.

119
00:05:24,041 --> 00:05:25,331
斯宾塞·潘丁是谁
Who's Spencer Patine?

120
00:05:25,391 --> 00:05:27,371
你认得斯宾塞的 就是手里带家伙的那个
You know Spencer- the guy with the arm.

121
00:05:27,481 --> 00:05:28,231
等会儿 抄什么"家伙"
Wait. What kind of arm?

122
00:05:28,231 --> 00:05:29,501
你说的"家伙"是什么意思啊
What is that even mean?

123
00:05:29,501 --> 00:05:30,781
他叔叔就是托比叔叔
His uncle is Uncle Toby.

124
00:05:30,781 --> 00:05:33,761
托比叔叔啊 我会把他加入"安珀警报"名单的
Oh, Uncle Toby. I'll be sure to include that in my Amber Alert.

125
00:05:33,761 --> 00:05:36,271
-我的天啊 -我能插句话吗
- Oh, my God! - Okay. Can I step in here?

126
00:05:36,271 --> 00:05:37,272
我觉得我能帮上忙
I think I can help.

127
00:05:37,391 --> 00:05:39,181
海莉 你妈妈担心的是
Haley, what your mom is worried about...

128
00:05:39,181 --> 00:05:40,691
你的心会被伤透
is you getting your heart broken

129
00:05:40,691 --> 00:05:42,580
因为迪兰明年就要上大学去了
when Dylan goes off to college next year.

130
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:43,900
-他不上大学 -我担心的不是...
- He's not going to college. - That's not what I'm-

131
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:45,730
他不上大学
He's not going to college?

132
00:05:45,730 --> 00:05:48,190
他是混乐队的好吧 他们要去巡演呢
He's in a band, okay? They're going on tour.

133
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:49,750
事情发展的真是越来越"好"了
Oh, this just gets better and better.

134
00:05:49,750 --> 00:05:52,750
为什么你们每件事都要替我做主
Why are you always on me about everything?

135
00:05:52,750 --> 00:05:54,830
-因为你必须明白 -好啦 大家冷静一下
- Because you need to understand... - Okay. Everybody, calm down!

136
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,830
我们从头来说一说
Let's start from the beginning.

137
00:05:57,280 --> 00:05:59,970
斯宾塞手里带什么家伙了
What's wrong with Spencer's arm?

138
00:06:04,449 --> 00:06:05,939
妈 我回来了
Mom, I'm home!

139
00:06:05,939 --> 00:06:09,439
宝贝 睡衣派对好玩吗
Ay, baby! Did you have fun at the slumber party?

140
00:06:10,089 --> 00:06:11,669
你肯定累坏了
You must be exhausted.

141
00:06:11,669 --> 00:06:13,199
不 我一点儿也不累
No, I'm not tired at all.

142
00:06:13,199 --> 00:06:15,009
我是第一个睡着的
I was the first one to fall asleep.

143
00:06:16,209 --> 00:06:17,419
你脸上是什么
What's on your face?

144
00:06:17,419 --> 00:06:20,019
是与朋友欢聚后的幸福笑容
A smile from having such a good time with my friends.

145
00:06:20,019 --> 00:06:21,659
不是的 过来
No. Come here.

146
00:06:25,128 --> 00:06:26,478
看
Look.

147
00:06:27,928 --> 00:06:29,398
原来他们是笑这个啊
That's why they were laughing.

148
00:06:29,688 --> 00:06:32,048
我还以为是我对时事的评论很逗呢
I thought it was my funny take on current events.

149
00:06:32,928 --> 00:06:34,628
他们为什么要干这种事
Why would they do something like that?

150
00:06:34,628 --> 00:06:35,818
没什么好担心的
Don't worry about it.

151
00:06:35,818 --> 00:06:37,708
小孩子们成天就搞这种恶作剧
Guys pull pranks like that all the time.

152
00:06:37,708 --> 00:06:39,368
你也捉弄他们一下呗
You just gotta prank 'em back.

153
00:06:39,368 --> 00:06:40,147
要让他们知道
You just gotta show 'em

154
00:06:40,147 --> 00:06:41,967
你是会以牙还牙的
you're willing to give as good as you get.

155
00:06:44,397 --> 00:06:45,448
你想什么呢
What do you think?

156
00:06:47,367 --> 00:06:48,757
报仇
Revenge.

157
00:06:50,437 --> 00:06:51,368
我还挺喜欢的
I like it.

158
00:06:54,627 --> 00:06:58,187
妈妈 也许我们不该旧事重提
Well, Mom, instead of dredging up the whole incident,

159
00:06:58,257 --> 00:07:00,426
就直接全部忘掉好了
maybe we should just try and repress it,

160
00:07:00,426 --> 00:07:01,716
就像一般家庭那样
like a- like a normal family.

161
00:07:01,716 --> 00:07:03,786
我不行 我得来个了断
I can't. I need closure.

162
00:07:04,176 --> 00:07:07,196
我的人生即将开始新的旅程了
I'm about to embark on a new journey.

163
00:07:07,266 --> 00:07:09,046
我认识了个男人
I met a man.

164
00:07:09,046 --> 00:07:09,577
是吗
Really?

165
00:07:09,636 --> 00:07:11,236
他叫查斯
His name is Chas,

166
00:07:11,236 --> 00:07:14,906
而且他让我搬到国外和他双宿双飞
and he's asked me to come live with him in his foreign land.

167
00:07:14,906 --> 00:07:15,986
去哪儿呢
Wow. Where?

168
00:07:15,986 --> 00:07:16,957
加拿大
Canada.

169
00:07:17,026 --> 00:07:18,925
你要搬到加拿大去吗
You're moving to-to Canada?

170
00:07:18,925 --> 00:07:20,495
加拿大法语区
French Canada.

171
00:07:21,875 --> 00:07:23,505
真棒呀
That's wonderful.

172
00:07:23,565 --> 00:07:25,035
确实很棒
It is wonderful.

173
00:07:25,035 --> 00:07:27,455
只是我一想到自己对歌洛莉亚和杰
It's just that when I think of all the awful things...

174
00:07:27,455 --> 00:07:31,845
以及对你和克莱尔说过的那些恶言
that I said to Gloria and Jay and you and Claire,

